  "Poisonous when eaten": "食用后中毒",
  "Disabled By Config!": "配置被禁用!",
  "Natural Arts": "自然艺术",
  "Bark Harvesting": "树皮采集",
  "Trees are very important to natural magic. Using some wood and saplings, you can create a knife capable of softly harvesting the bark from trees, which can be used in recipes and rituals. Right-click a log block to harvest bark from it, with a chance of breaking the log block.": "树木对自然魔法十分重要. 用木材和树苗制成去皮刀后, 便可轻柔地采集树皮, 用于合成和仪式. 右击原木方块可收获树皮, 并有一定概率将原木变为去皮原木.",
  "Simple Materials": "基础材料",
  "Berries": "浆果",
  "When breaking some leaves by hand, you may occasionally find a random berry. There are five different kinds of berries, each one with different properties. Some may even be used in spells or rituals later on...": "当你清理树叶时, 可能偶尔会发现一些浆果. 有五种特性不同的浆果. 或许能在未来的仪式和法术派上用场.",
  "Foraging": "觅食",
  "This simple mixture can grow grass on dirt. Simply right-click to throw the powder at a block within 4 blocks of you, growing grass in a small area.": "这种简单的混合物能让泥土长出草地. 右击将粉末抛向身边 4 格内的方块, 即可让一小片区域长出草地.",
  "Lawn Care": "草坪护理",
  "Rare Materials": "稀有材料",
  "In the world around you, you may find several rare plants and herbs that are crucial for many aspects of natural magic.": "这些材料在自然之中随处可见, 它们可以被应用于各类法术的方方面面.",
  "Roots of Magic": "魔法的根源",
  "Old roots can be found at a 1/40 chance when breaking tall grass. They are needed for a lot of early magic, as they are required for spells without modifiers. They can also be eaten to restore a very small amount of hunger.": "破坏高草丛时有 1/40 的概率获得活根. 许多早期魔法都需要它, 因为制作无修饰法术必须使用活根. 它也可以食用, 恢复极少量饱食度.",
  "Old Roots": "活根",
  "Verdant sprigs will drop at a 1/30 chance when harvesting fully-grown crops of all kinds. They have innate life force that persists after being harvested, so their uses often relate to bringing life to objects.": "在收获成熟的农作物时,  有一定概率(1/30)获得嫩枝. 它们蕴含的生命力极为强大, 即使被采摘下来也能保持很长时间. 因此它们的用途通常与给物体带来生命有关.",
  "Verdant Sprigs": "嫩枝",
  "Infernal Bulbs will drop at a 1/20 chance from grown nether wart. Infernal bulbs are imbued with the fire of their home in the nether, so they are useful when a large amount of energy is needed. They can also be used as fairly effective furnace fuel, or given to skeletons to make them withered.": "成熟的下界疣有 1/20 的概率掉落地狱根茎. 它蕴含着故乡下界的火焰, 适合需要大量能量的用途. 也可作为高效的熔炉燃料, 或给予骷髅使其变为凋灵骷髅.",
  "Infernal Bulbs": "地狱根茎",
  "Dragon's eyes will drop at a 1/10 chance from chorus flowers. They are imbued with the same eldritch energy as the ender dragon itself. In addition to spell-related uses, they can be eaten for a more powerful chorus fruit effect, or smelted to yield one ender pearl.": "在获取紫颂花时, 有一定概率(1/10)获得紫颂龙眼. 它们与末影龙一样有着末地的魔力. 除了与魔法有关的用途外, 也能够被食用. 其有更强大的紫颂果效果. 还可以被熔炼成末影珍珠.",
  "Dragon's Eyes": "紫颂龙眼",
  "Using the power of a nether star, you have created a powder capable of mutating new kinds of flora. This powder is only used in very specific circumstances, specified in the spell components section of this tablet.": "利用下界之星的力量, 你创造了能让植物异变的特殊粉末. 这种粉末只在非常特殊的情况下使用, 详见符文石板的法术部分.",
  "New Plants": "新植物",
  "Verdant Sprigs are commonly used for their life-related properties. By applying the pulp of a verdant sprig to your wounds with these poultices, you can heal a small amount of health.": "嫩枝通常用于它们与生命力有关的事上. 用这些膏药在伤口上涂抹, 你可以恢复少量的生命值.",
  "Medicine": "跌打损伤怎么办",
  "While Old Roots can be eaten alone, they're not very appetizing. By cooking it with some wheat in a bowl, you can create a delicious stew capable of replenishing much more hunger.": "虽然活根可以直接食用, 但并不足以果腹. 放在碗中与小麦一同烹饪, 你做出了美味的活根炖菜. 可以补充更多的饱食度.",
  "Soup For You": "喝口汤吧",
  "Rituals": "仪式",
  "Animal Reanimation": "动物复活",
  "With the enhanced channeling abilities of the standing stones, you believe that you could imbue the corpse of a dead creature with enough healing energy to bring it back to life. Given the flesh and bones of a passive mob, these rituals will bring that mob back to life on top of the altar.": "通过石碑增强通灵能力, 你相信可以使那些死亡的生物复活. 利用被动生物的骨肉, 这些仪式将令它们在祭坛中复活.",
  "Life Giver": "复活吧我的勇士",
  "Ritual: Pig Summoning": "仪式: 猪召唤",
  "Ritual: Cow Summoning": "仪式: 牛召唤",
  "Ritual: Sheep Summoning": "仪式: 羊召唤",
  "Ritual: Chicken Summoning": "仪式: 鸡召唤",
  "Ritual: Rabbit Summoning": "仪式: 兔召唤",
  "The Crystal Staff": "水晶法杖",
  "For too long, you have been bound by the limited number of uses of your typical staff. Using rare crystals from deep within the earth, you believe you have created a way to store spells indefinitely: the crystal staff. Not only can this staff keep spells indefinitely, it can also store up to four at a time.": "长期以来, 你一直因为使用法术有次数限制而倍感折磨. 利用这些来自地下深处的水晶, 你相信你创造了能够无限释放法术的方法: 水晶法杖. 这根法杖可以无限次的使用法术, 但同时最多储存四种. 注意: 部分法术无法储存.",
  "Reusable Magic": "可重复使用的魔法",
  "Ritual: Crystal Forge": "仪式: 水晶锻造",
  "Adding spells to the staff requires a separate ritual. In addition to this ritual's displayed components, you may add up to four additional Spell Powders as incenses. Each of these will be added to the staff, overwriting previous spells if necessary. Simply sneak and right-click to cycle through the staff's spells.": "向杖中添加法术需要一个单独的仪式. 除了仪式的配方之外, 你可以在熏香炉添加额外四个法术粉末, 每一个都会被加入杖中. 只需蹲下同时点击鼠标右键, 就能切换杖中的法术.",
  "Adding Spells": "添加法术",
  "Ritual: Crystal Imbue": "仪式: 水晶浸透",
  "However, this new staff has one major limitation: it must be used while standing on natural blocks like dirt, grass, leaves, or log blocks. Otherwise, the staff will tap into the user's own life force to cast spells.": "水晶法杖施法会消耗使用者的泰拉能量, 能量不足时无法施放. 效率修饰可降低每次施法的泰拉消耗.",
  "Limitations": "还有一件事",
  "Using the properties of a Runic Focus, you have created a new weapon. During the crafting of this weapon you can burn up to four different kinds of barks as additional incenses to add different buffs to the sword. You can mix and match these buffs as you please, and they will stack if you put more than one on at a time.": "你使用符文聚焦的特性创造了一把新武器. 你可以在制作过程中燃烧不同的树皮来获得 不同的增益效果. 你可以随心所欲的搭配不同增益. 重复使用还可叠加.",
  "Modular Weapon": "模块化武器",
  "Ritual: Engraved Blade": "仪式: 符文篆刻",
  "Each acacia bark you burn as incense during the sword's crafting will add some generic damage to the sword.": "在剑的制作过程中, 你燃烧的每一片金合欢木树皮 都会对剑增加一些普通伤害.",
  "Each spruce bark you burn as incense during the sword's crafting will add additional knockback to the sword's attacks.": "在剑的制作过程中, 你燃烧的每一片云杉木树皮 都会为剑的攻击增加额外的击退.",
  "Each birch bark you burn as incense during the sword's crafting will add some bonus damage whenever the sword attacks undead creatures.": "在剑的制作过程中, 你燃烧的每一片白桦木树皮 都会让剑获得对不死生物的额外伤害.",
  "Each jungle bark you burn as incense during the sword's crafting will add a small amount of drowning damage to the sword's damage output.": "在剑的制作过程中, 你燃烧的每一片丛林木树皮 都会令剑增加少量的溺水伤害.",
  "Each dark oak bark you burn as incense during the sword's crafting will increase your chance to dodge attacks made against you when holding the sword.": "在剑的制作过程中, 你燃烧的每一片深色橡木树皮 都会增加你在持剑时躲避攻击的几率.",
  "Fire Blast": "火焰冲击",
  "Not all of your rituals are for happy, fun purposes like toggling the rain or bringing your pet pig back to life. The flare ritual uses some fiery materials from the nether as well as some volatile fuels to burn mobs inside a 45x45x17 area around the altar, except for players immediately near the altar.": "并非所有的仪式, 都像是下雨或让你的宠物起死回生 一样为了快乐有趣而设计. 这个仪式使用一些来自下界的火热材料以及 一些挥发性燃料在祭坛周围45x45x17区域内 燃烧生物, 但祭坛附近的玩家除外.",
  "Offensive Rituals": "豪火球之术",
  "Ritual: Flare": "仪式: 火焰冲击",
  "Growth Ritual": "生长仪式",
  "With the simple life-channeling abilities of the altar, you have devised a ritual that will aid the growth of your crops. This ritual will scan for crops in a 35x35x9 area and randomly apply a bonemeal-like effect to a few of them.": "凭借祭坛引导的生命力, 你设计了这个简单的生长仪式. 这个仪式将对35x35x9区域内的作物随机施加 骨粉效果.",
  "Spark of Life": "生命之火",
  "Ritual: Grow": "仪式: 生长",
  "The life force present in hostile mobs is corrupt and tainted. With this ritual, you have developed a means of taking this life force for more beneficial purposes. This ritual will damage all hostile mobs in a large area, and divide the damage dealt evenly among nearby players in the form of healing.": "那些面目可憎的怪物, 他们的生命力充斥着腐败与污秽. 这个仪式可以让你将那些无故浪费的生命力 用在更有益处的事上. 通过伤害大范围的所有敌对生物, 将夺来的生命力分配给附近的玩家.",
  "Taking It Back": "夺回来",
  "Ritual: Life Drain": "仪式: 生命汲取",
  "Living Tools": "蕴生工具",
  "Your rituals are capable of channeling life energy into previously dead objects. Using this, you can grow newer, stronger forms for your wooden tools. Adding a little gold for reinforcement, as well as a verdant sprig to grow upon, will grant you tools of similar strength to iron that repair slowly over time.": "你的仪式可以将生命力引入死物. 利用这一特点, 你可以让木制工具再度获得生命. 只需添加一点金子以及嫩枝, 就可以获得铁制工具的强度, 并且能够随时间推移缓慢恢复自身.",
  "Self-Repairing": "自我修复",
  "Ritual: Living Pickaxe": "仪式: 蕴生之镐",
  "Ritual: Living Axe": "仪式: 蕴生之斧",
  "Ritual: Living Shovel": "仪式: 蕴生之铲",
  "Ritual: Living Sword": "仪式: 蕴生之剑",
  "Ritual: Living Hoe": "仪式: 蕴生之锄",
  "By burning common breeding items as incense, you have developed a ritual that will cause all breedable mobs within a 45x45x17 box to enter breeding mode.": "将这些材料当做熏香燃烧, 便成为了一个全新的仪式. 这个仪式可以令45x45x17方块内的所有可繁殖 生物进入繁殖状态.",
  "Animal Farm": "又到了交配的季节",
  "Ritual: Mass Breeding": "仪式: 繁殖季节",
  "Monster Reanimation": "怪物召唤",
  "With a more powerful altar, you think you might be able to apply your previous reanimation rituals to some more powerful and sinister targets. By supplying a bone and some related drops, you can summon forth a mob of your choice on top of the altar.": "有了更强大的祭坛, 之前的复活仪式便能应用于一些敌对生物. 通过提供骨头和一些相关的掉落物, 你可以召唤出你选择的敌对生物.",
  "Undeath": "为你而战, 我的女士",
  "Ritual: Zombie Summoning": "仪式: 僵尸召唤",
  "Ritual: Skeleton Summoning": "仪式: 骷髅召唤",
  "Ritual: Spider Summoning": "仪式: 蜘蛛召唤",
  "Ritual: Creeper Summoning": "仪式: 爬行者召唤",
  "Ritual: Cave Spider Summoning": "仪式: 洞穴蜘蛛召唤",
  "Ritual: Slime Summoning": "仪式: 史莱姆召唤",
  "Ritual: Enderman Summoning": "仪式: 末影人召唤",
  "Energized Stones": "符文石碑",
  "Ritual: Igniter Stone": "仪式: 燃烧石碑",
  "The igniter stone will light nearby creatures on fire for a few seconds.": "燃烧石碑将点燃附近的生物几秒钟.",
  "Igniter": "这打火机烧不出来了",
  "Ritual: Repulsor Stone": "仪式: 斥力石碑",
  "The repulsor stone will push nearby dropped items away from itself.": "斥力石碑可以推开周围的掉落物.",
  "Repulsor": "单推",
  "Ritual: Vacuum Stone": "仪式: 引力石碑",
  "The vacuum stone will pull nearby dropped items in towards itself.": "引力石碑可以吸引周围的掉落物.",
  "Vacuum": "暴风吸入绝绝子",
  "Ritual: Standing Stone": "仪式: 装饰石碑",
  "A basic standing stone. Particles can be colored using Rose red, Lapis Lazuli, Cactus Green and reset using bone meal.": "最为普通的石碑. 可以使用染料染色, 用骨粉重置颜色.",
  "You've used standing stones to channel life energy before, but never on their own. However, using the innate power within an infernal bulb and the regenerative effects of a ritual, you have created standing stones that will perform a simple purpose in an area around them forever, without cost.": "你以前用过这些石碑来输送生命能量, 但从未单独使用. 现在, 利用地狱根茎的能量和仪式的效果, 你创造了符文石碑. 它们将永远的在周围区域发挥作用, 且无需任何成本.",
  "Simple Yet Effective": "简单且高效",
  "Ritual: Accelerator Stone": "仪式: 加速石碑",
  "The accelerator stone will grant all nearby creatures the Speed II potion effect.": "加速石碑将赋予周围所有生物速度II效果.",
  "Accelerator": "跑起来跑起来",
  "Ritual: Entangler Stone": "仪式: 缠绕石碑",
  "The Entangler stone will grant all nearby creatures the Slowness II potion effect.": "缠绕石碑将赋予周围所有生物缓慢II效果.",
  "Entangler": "虽然没有触手",
  "Ritual: Grower Stone": "仪式: 生长石碑",
  "The grower stone will slightly boost the growth speed of nearby crops.": "生长石碑将略微提高周围作物的生长速度.",
  "Grower": "拔苗助长",
  "Ritual: Healer Stone": "仪式: 治愈石碑",
  "The healer stone will grant the regeneration potion effect to all nearby creatures.": "治愈石碑将赋予周围所有生物再生效果.",
  "Healer": "萨尼铁塔!",
  "Downfall Control": "降雨控制",
  "With a few simple natural ingredients, you have discovered two rituals, one that will summon rain to the world and another to banish it.": "通过观察气候现象, 你发现了这两种仪式, 一种是召唤雨水到世界, 另一种是驱逐它.",
  "Weather Magic": "天气魔法",
  "Ritual: Summon Rain": "仪式: 召唤雨水",
  "Ritual: Banish Rain": "仪式: 驱除雨水",
  "Basic Ritual Mechanics": "仪式祭坛",
  "With your acquisition of materials from deep within the earth, you have created a new structure that allows you to cast more powerful magic than ever before. Different rituals may be performed at the altar, each one requiring different components and conditions to operate.": "利用在地下深处获取的材料, 你创造了一个新设施. 它可以释放比之前任何时候都要强大的法术. 祭坛上可以进行各种仪式, 每个仪式都需要不同的条件才能运作.",
  "The Altar": "仪式祭坛",
  "Most rituals, if not all, require incense to function. Incense braziers will only be counted if they are within a 9x9 area around the altar, and on the same level. Items may be placed within the brazier, and ignited with a flint and steel. An incense brazier can be extinguished by sneak-right-clicking with an empty hand.": "在大部分仪式中都需要熏香才能正确进行. 熏香炉只有在祭坛9x9的区域内, 并且在同一水平线才能够被正确计算. 将物品放入熏香炉用打火石点燃. 可以通过空手右击熄灭.",
  "Incense": "熏香炉",
  "A typical ritual is cast as follows: first, necessary items are placed on the altar, and necessary incense items are ignited. Make sure you don't have any extra ingredients in the altar, or extra incenses in the air, or the ritual will fail. Then, sneak-right-click the altar with an empty hand to begin the ritual.": "一个基础的仪式是这样的. 首先将物品放入祭坛, 再点燃熏香. 过程中确保没有多余的物品或错误的熏香, 否则仪式就会失败. 最后用空手潜行右击开始仪式.",
  "Basic Casting": "基本流程",
  "Runic Foci": "符文聚焦",
  "By engraving this stone with some runes, and placing a rare gem at its core, you have created an item that will store up life energy. It can be charged with a ritual at an altar, and then either discharged or incorporated into other items in rituals or other processes.": "在石板上刻下符文, 并在核心嵌入稀有宝石, 你创造了能够储存生命能量的物品. 可在祭坛上通过仪式为它充能, 随后释放能量, 或在仪式及其他过程中将其用于制作其他物品.",
  "Stored Power": "储能",
  "Ritual: Runic Focus": "仪式: 符文聚焦",
  "To actually charge the focus, you need some energetic dust from the overworld, as well as some energetic dust from the nether. Using the fiery energies of an infernal stem, you can force the energy from the dusts into the focus, along with the life energy that accompanies all rituals.": "想要真正为符文聚焦板充能, 你需要分别来自主世界和下界的能量. 使用地狱根茎, 可以迫使这些能量随着仪式的生命能量共同 汇入聚焦板.",
  "Charging It Up": "充能",
  "Ritual: Runic Focus Charging": "仪式: 符文聚焦充能",
  "You are simply fed up with going on long adventures searching for specific plants to complete your spells. With this ritual, you have developed a sinister solution. When this ritual finishes its particle light show, it will instantly kill a mob placed near it. In exchange, a random plant may be dropped from the altar. The source of these drops remains unknown to you...": "你厌倦了为了特定植物而长途冒险, 只为完成法术. 这个仪式提供了一个阴险的解决办法. 当粒子光效结束后, 它会立即杀死附近放置的一个生物. 作为交换, 祭坛可能掉出随机植物. 这些掉落物的来源, 你仍无从得知...",
  "A Supernatural Deal": "不公平的交易",
  "Ritual: Sacrifice": "仪式: 牺牲",
  "Standing Stones": "石碑",
  "In order to gain access to more powerful rituals, you need a better way to channel life energy from the world around you. By carving runes into this stone structure, you give it the much-needed ability to draw in power from the world around it to fuel your magical desires.": "为了更强大的仪式, 你需要更好的方式来引导世界中的生命能量. 在石头上雕刻符文, 赋予它你需要的能力, 便能从世界中汲取能量, 满足你的求知欲望.",
  "Engraved Stones": "雕刻石碑",
  "Enhanced Standing Stones": "附魔石碑",
  "One again, you've hit a wall. Your standing stones are powerful, but you are sure that there is a lot of more powerful magic that still eludes you. With a trip to the nether, however, you have discovered that by using some more energetic materials, you can create stones far more effective at channeling life energy.": "再一次, 你碰壁了. 你的石碑很强大, 但你确信还有更强大的魔法仍然躲避着你. 在下界之旅中, 你获得了更具能量的材料, 你可以创造出更有效引导生命能量的石碑.",
  "The Next Level": "下一阶段",
  "Sylvan Armor": "繁森盔甲",
  "With your new, stronger altar, you might want your apparel to follow suit. Using some leather armor as a base, you have managed to create a form of magically-cooperative robe. This equipment doesn't have the best protection, but it will auto-repair and boost the efficiency modifier of your spells by two.": "祭坛翻新, 装备当然也要跟上脚步. 使用皮革装备为基础, 你制作了这件盔甲. 即便不是最好的, 但它具有自我修复, 还能提升你的法术效率.",
  "Druidic Robes": "就像德鲁伊一样",
  "Ritual: Sylvan Hood": "仪式: 繁森头盔",
  "Ritual: Sylvan Robe": "仪式: 繁森胸甲",
  "Ritual: Sylvan Tunic": "仪式: 繁森护腿",
  "Ritual: Sylvan Boots": "仪式: 繁森靴子",
  "Time Shift": "时间转移",
  "After many hours you have discovered that by burning common time keeping devices you can move time by an amount proportional to the amount of clocks burned as incense.": "你发现通过燃烧常见的计时装置, 就可以改变时间. 时间流逝的多少与燃烧的数量成正比.",
  "Timey Wimey Stuff": "浪费时间",
  "Ritual: Time Shift": "仪式: 时间转移",
  "Wildwood Armor": "野木盔甲",
  "Fancy robes are nice and all, but sometimes you just want raw protection. The wildwood armor, built off of iron armor as a base, satisfies that purpose nicely. It has protection in-between iron and diamond armor, but also auto-repairs and increases your natural regeneration, even when out of food.": "穿的时髦固然很好, 但有时候的确想要拥抱自然. 野木盔甲以铁制装备为基础, 却提供接近钻石装备的防御. 还能自动修复并增加你的生命恢复.",
  "Wooden Armor": "木制盔甲?",
  "Spellcraft": "法术入门",
  "Spell Component: Rending Strike": "法术: 撕裂打击",
  "Alliums contain a modicum of destructive energy. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will deal simple damage to its targets. In addition to this, if the target is holding a tool or wearing armor, their equipment will be damaged severely.": "这个配方合成的法术可以对目标造成伤害. 此外, 若目标身穿装备手持工具, 这些装备将受到严重损坏.",
  "Equipment Breaker": "碎甲碎甲!大残!",
  "Spell Component: Nature's Cure": "法术: 自然疗法",
  "You have discovered that apples have some level of curative properties. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will take any negative effects currently on you and transform them to their positive variants, if such variants exist.": "苹果同样有着治疗的功效. 这个配方合成的法术将你身上的负面效果转 变为正面.",
  "Remedy": "逆转劣势",
  "Spell Component: Shatter": "法术: 支离破碎",
  "The azure bluet contains latent energy capable of shattering stone. Using the above recipe, you create a spell capable of breaking a small area of blocks that you target. The spell has a mining level equivalent to an iron tool, increasable with potency modifiers.": "这个配方合成的法术能破坏面前的一个方块. 挖掘等级相当于铁镐, 可以通过修饰来增加.",
  "Mining with Magic": "用魔力挖矿",
  "Spell Component: Earth Spike": "法术: 大地尖刺",
  "The blue orchid seems to be related to the earth and ground. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will create an earth spike on a nearby block that you look at. The spike will throw mobs into the air, but can also be used as a quick defensive wall or as a way to duplicate simple materials like dirt, stone, sand, or gravel.": "这个配方合成的法术能够在面前创造尖刺. 这些尖刺可以将怪物顶到空中. 也可用作快速搭建防御墙, 复制泥土, 石头, 沙子, 砂砾这类简单材料.",
  "The Best Offense...": "进攻就是最好的防守",
  "Spell Component: Ender Warp": "法术: 末影移动",
  "Just eating a chorus fruit on its own is enough to grant a random teleport. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell with greater control over this ability, letting the user teleport forward, even through walls or when falling.": "只是简单地吃掉紫颂果就足以传送. 这个配方合成的法术让你更好的控制它. 传送到你看到的位置, 即使在障碍物后或摔落时也能使用.",
  "Teleportation": "闪耀",
  "Spell Component: Dandelion Winds": "法术: 蒲公英风",
  "You have discovered that the dandelion has powers relating to the wind. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell capable of blasting back entities in front of you.": "这个配方合成的法术能够吹走你面前的实体.",
  "Gust": "一阵强风",
  "Spell Component: Combustion": "法术: 毁灭之环",
  "Using the mutating powder in the nether, you create a burning red flower. To create, plant a blue orchid in the nether. Make a ring of netherrack around the flower. While under the fire resistance effect, toss a blaze rod and lava bucket near the flower, then use the powder on the flower.": "在下界使用异变粉末, 你能创造出燃烧的红花. 先在下界种一朵兰花, 周围围一圈下界岩. 在抗火效果下, 将烈焰棒和熔岩桶丢在花旁, 再对花使用粉末.",
  "Fiery Flora": "愤怒的植物",
  "The new flower you have created is bursting with the chaotic fire of the nether. Using the above recipe, you can use it to create a spell that will allow you to create large explosions on blocks that you look at.": "这朵花正欲和下界的混沌之火一同绽放. 这个配方合成的法术可以让你目光所及的方块爆炸.",
  "Destruction": "愿癫火充满世间!",
  "Imbuing a Staff": "法术灌注",
  "Your mortar and pestle yield a fine Spell Powder for use in spells, but it can't really be used on its own. With this device, you channel natural energies from that powder into a branch of wood. Simply place in a stick, place in your powder, and wait for your staff to pop out.": "研钵和石杵可以制造出一种良好的魔法粉末. 它可以用于施法, 但不能单独使用. 有了这个装置, 你可以将粉末中的自然能量导入木棍. 将木棍置入, 随后放入魔法粉末, 稍作等待便可.",
  "The Imbuer": "法术灌注台",
  "Magic staves are very simple to use. Imbued with the power of nature, all you need to do is hold right-click to charge up a spell, and after about a second release right-click to cast it. Staves have limited uses, and will be destroyed completely after their charges are used up. The number of charges can be increased with the use of the efficiency modifier.": "法杖使用起来非常简单. 它充满了自然的力量, 你只需按住鼠标右键蓄力, 在蓄力完成后松开右键来施放它. 法杖的耐久有限, 在耐久耗尽后会被彻底销毁. 使用修饰可以调整法术的强弱.",
  "Staff Mechanics": "法杖技术",
  "Spell Component: Growth": "法术: 生生不息",
  "You have discovered that lilacs contain a spark of growth energy deep within them. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell capable of growing nearby plant life. The spell will target a growable plants around the targeted block, and has a chance of applying a bonemeal effect to each one.": "你发现丁香蕴含着无穷尽的生长能量. 这个配方合成的法术将加快作物的生长速度, 还有一定概率施加骨粉效果.",
  "Magical Fertilizer": "无污染肥料",
  "Spell Component: Water Blast": "法术: 水流冲击",
  "Being an aquatic plant, you'd expect lily pads to have some kind of power relating to the water. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will create a burst of temporary water 4 blocks in front of you. This spell is quite useful for extinguishing fires, or pushing back nearby mobs.": "作为水生植物, 睡莲理应具有与水有关的力量. 上述配方能制作一个在你前方 4 格处喷出暂时水流的法术. 它很适合灭火或推开附近生物.",
  "Fire Extinguisher": "杰尼杰尼",
  "Terra": "泰拉",
  "When you hold your new staff in your hand, you notice a power awakened within you, as well as a conveniently placed bar on your screen. These leaves represent a life force deep within you, called Terra, that powers your spells. All spells will cost a certain amount of this energy, but it will regenerate fairly quickly over time.": "当你将法杖握在手中时, 你会感受到一股新的力量在体内觉醒. 在饱食度上方增加新的状态栏. 这个状态栏代表着你体内的生命力量, 其名为泰拉. 它会为你的法术提供能量. 每次施法都会消耗一定量的泰拉. 随着时间的推移, 泰拉会缓慢恢复.",
  "Casting Costs": "施法消耗",
  "Spell Component: Time Stop": "法术: 时间停止",
  "Using the mutating powder in the end, you create a flower black as night. To create, plant a poppy two blocks above obsidian in the end. While under the slowness effect, toss a coal block next to the flower and use the powder on the flower.": "在末地使用异变粉末, 你就能创造出一朵如夜般漆黑的花. 要做到这一点, 需要在末地种植一朵虞美人, 在其下方放置两块黑曜石, 处于缓慢效果时在花旁丢下一块煤炭块, 最后使用异变粉末.",
  "Ender Flower": "法术: 时间停止",
  "The new flower you have created is bursting with powers beyond your control. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will stop time for all entities in an area around you. They will not update until the spell ends, during which time you can move, attack, or gloat at them.": "你创造的新花朵蕴藏着难以控制的力量. 上述配方能制作一个停止周围实体时间的法术. 法术结束前, 它们不会更新, 而你仍可移动, 攻击或得意地看着它们.",
  "Chronomage": "时间魔术师",
  "Modifiers": "法术修改",
  "Mixing some modifiers into your spells can make them much more powerful. Potency modifiers (glowstone dust) will improve the strength of a spell's effects. Efficiency modifiers (redstone dust) will improve the casting cost and number of uses a spell has. Size modifiers (gunpowder) will improve the area a spell effects.": "在法术中混入修饰材料可使其更强大. 效力修饰(萤石粉)增强法术效果. 效率修饰(红石粉)改善施法消耗并增加使用次数. 范围修饰(火药)扩大法术作用区域.",
  "More Bang For Your Buck": "事半功倍",
  "For a spell to have modifiers, though, certain base ingredients are required. Old Roots will allow a spell to be crafted, but permit no modifiers. Verdant Sprigs can support one modifier slot, Infernal Bulbs can support two, and Dragon's Eyes can support three. These ingredients must be added first, before any other modifiers are added to the mortar.": "不过要想修饰法术, 你需要某些基本成分. 活根允许制作法术, 但不允许修饰. 嫩枝可以提供一次修饰. 地狱根茎可以提供两次. 紫颂龙眼可以提供三次. 向研钵中添加任何修饰之前, 你必须先添加这些成分.",
  "Base Ingredients": "基本成分",
  "The Mortar": "研钵",
  "The flora in the world around you seem to have vast untapped power. What better way to access that than mashing them into a pulp?": "这些植物有着巨大的潜力. 有什么比捣碎成泥更好的利用方式呢?",
  "Of course, to mash the aforementioned plants into a pulp, you're going to need something to mash with. This pestle, fashioned out of a smooth white stone, should do the task nicely.": "当然, 你的方块手做不到这么细致的操作, 这个石杵用闪长岩制成, 可以更好的完成任务.",
  "The Pestle": "石杵",
  "Using the mortar and pestle is quite simple. Detailed in this tablet are many recipes for different spells. You will need all of these ingredients, as well as a particular base ingredient. To create the most basic possible spell, simply place in the spell's recipe, as well as an old root. This will allow for a spell with no modifiers.": "使用研钵和石杵很简单. 符文石板中详细记载了各种法术的配方. 你会用到它们与一种特殊的基础材料混合. 要创造最基本的法术, 只需在配方中加入一个活根即可.",
  "Usage": "用法",
  "Spell Component: Inferno": "法术: 地狱烈焰",
  "Nether wart has absorbed a lot from its fiery home in the nether. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will both damage and ignite hit targets.": "地狱疣充满了来自地狱的炽热能量. 这个配方合成的法术可以点燃并伤害目标.",
  "Fireball": "火球",
  "Spell Component: Shielding": "法术: 刚毅护盾",
  "The orange tulip is associated with protection and resistance. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will repel mobs and stop projectiles while holding-right click on the spell.": "橙色郁金香让人联想到保护和抵抗. 这个配方合成的法术将击退和阻拦周围怪物 与投射物. 持续按住右键施法.",
  "Force Field": "排斥立场",
  "Spell Component: Acceleration": "法术: 时间加速",
  "The oxeye daisy is attuned to the passage of time itself. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell capable of increasing the tick rate of furnaces, brewing stands, or other devices that you target with your spell. By default, the spell will triple the rate of these devices.": "滨菊是时间流逝的象征. 这个配方合成的法术能够加速熔炉, 酿造台 或其他设备的工作效率. 一般情况下你的施法目标将被加速三倍.",
  "Overclocked": "绯红之王",
  "Spell Component: Regeneration": "法术: 疗愈光环",
  "You have found that peonies have a gentle healing character to them. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will simply heal you a small amount.": "对牡丹温和的治疗能力加以运用. 这个配方合成的法术可为你恢复少量生命值.",
  "Gentle Touch": "微风拂过...",
  "Spell Component: Life Drain": "法术: 生命汲取",
  "You have found that the pink tulip can closely link with the life force of living creatures. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell capable of damaging hit entities, while simultaneously stealing some of their life force to regenerate yours.": "粉红色郁金香与生物的生命力密切相关. 这个配方合成的法术可以攻击目标, 为你恢复少量的生命.",
  "Vampirism": "吸血鬼的拿手好戏",
  "Spell Component: Electric Spark": "法术: 雷霆之怒",
  "The innate charge of a potato combined with the harmfulness of its poison create a highly destructive spell. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will simply strike lightning on a nearby block you look at.": "土豆的电荷与毒巧妙地结合在一起, 形成了这个极具破坏力的法术. 这个配方合成的法术可以雷击你面前的区域.",
  "Lightning Strike": "你不准参加",
  "Spell Component: Insanity": "法术: 混乱打击",
  "Poppies can naturally contain mind-altering compounds, so it follows that their abilities in a spell would involve the mind. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will cause nearby monsters to attack other nearby monsters.": "虞美人中含有能够改变思维的化合物.(?) 将它们用在法术中可以控制思维. 这个配方合成的法术可使附近怪物攻击其他 怪物.",
  "Betrayal": "嗨到不行呀!",
  "Spell Component: Radiance": "法术: 耀眼闪光",
  "Using the mutating flower in the overworld, you create a shining white flower. To create, plant an oxeye daisy. At noon, toss down a glowstone block and one prismarine crystal next to it, and while under the night vision effect, use the powder on the flower.": "在主世界使用异变粉末, 你就能创造出一朵闪烁着耀眼光芒的花. 要做到这一点, 需要在主世界种植一朵滨菊, 于正午时处于夜视效果在花旁丢下萤石块和 海晶砂粒, 最后使用异变粉末. 注意: 时间卡的很死.",
  "Flower of Light": "光之花",
  "The new flower you have created contains the very essence of the glowing daylight of the overworld. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell that will do very high damage to struck creatures in a large beam in front of you.": "这朵花饱含了日光的精华. 这个配方合成的法术可以制造一个攻击你面前生物的光束.",
  "Piercing Rays": "亮瞎狗眼",
  "Spell Component: Devil's Flower": "法术: 恶魔之花",
  "The allure of the red tulip seems to draw rather...sinister attention. Using the above recipe, you can summon a spectral skeleton to attack a nearby mob.": "红色郁金香的魅力似乎引来了某种... 阴险的注意. 使用上述配方, 你能召唤一只幽灵骷髅攻击附近的生物.",
  "Summoning": "禁忌召唤",
  "Spell Component: Rose's Thorns": "法术: 玫瑰荆棘",
  "You have discovered a way to capture the prickliness of a rose bush in your spells. Using the above recipe, you can create a spell capable of dealing raw damage to targets. Do note that this spell will not cause knockback.": "这个配方合成的法术利用了玫瑰来缠绕目标. 对目标造成伤害但不会击退.",
  "Natural Defenses": "发狂之舌 阿尔佩利希",
  "Spell Component: Solar Smite": "法术: 太阳耀斑",
  "A sunflower spends its entire life trying to absorb the sun's rays. Using the above recipe, you can tap into a bit of that stored sunlight, doing some damage to normal mobs, but dealing a massive amount of extra damage to undead monsters, as well as igniting them.": "向日葵终其一生都在吸收阳光. 这个配方合成的法术利用其储存的阳光, 对生物造成伤害. 对亡灵生物造成大量伤害并将其点燃.",
  "Bane of the Undead": "亡灵的天敌",
  "Spell Component: Blistering Cold": "法术: 刺骨寒冬",
  "The white tulip contains magical essences of cold and ice. Using the above recipe, you can free this cold power, creating a spell that will both damage and slow hit targets.": "白色郁金香带有寒冷与冰霜的精华. 这个配方合成的法术将释放它的力量. 对目标造成伤害的同时施加缓慢效果.",
  "Frozen Solid": "冻结",
  "Ritual started": "仪式开始",
  "efficiency": "效率",
  "potency": "效力",
  "size": "范围",
  "Type": "种类",
  "uses remaining": "剩余使用次数"
}
